{
  "name": "barclays-buk-data-product-builder",
  "description": "Generates production-ready PySpark pipelines for AWS Glue and Databricks from Excel mapping documents, transforms business requirements into formal data models, generates Source-to-Target Mappings from requirement documents, target data models, SQL/PySpark code, or interview questionnaires with users, and generates data validation SQL for Athena and Databricks with exact reconciliation and SCD2 temporal checks. Covers FDP, CDP and BDP data product types with full artefact generation, validation and deployment.",
